# GPL-3 for a different reason: these carry no upstream copyright line. Each
# one's own header credits only fuddlesworth, so the two Burn-My-Windows
# authors above must NOT be named here, whatever the shared licence suggests.
# They sit in their own stanza after the LGPL data stanza so last-match-wins
# still resolves them to GPL-3.
#
# glass/effect.frag describes itself as a port of kwin-effects-glass and
# frosted-glass/effect.frag as a port of the phosphor-shell frosted panel
# shader, but neither carries the second SPDX-FileCopyrightText that CLAUDE.md
# requires of a port. That is a question about those headers, not about this
# file, and it must not be answered by inventing a holder here.
Files: plasmazones/data/surface/blur/effect.frag
       plasmazones/data/surface/duotone/effect.frag
       plasmazones/data/surface/frosted-glass/effect.frag
